{
  "html": "<h1 id=\"gitpulse-markdown-viewer\">GitPulse <em>Markdown</em> <code>viewer</code><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#gitpulse-markdown-viewer\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>A paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>emphasis</em>, <em><strong>both</strong></em>, <del>struck</del>, <mark>highlighted <strong>strong</strong></mark>, <code>inline code</code>, a <a href=\"docs/guide.md#install\">relative link</a>, a <a href=\"/README.md\">root link</a>, an <a href=\"https://example.com/path?q=1\">external link</a>, a <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.com\">mail link</a>, a <a href=\"#tables\">section link</a>, a <a href=\"#\">script link</a> and an autolink <a href=\"https://example.org\">https://example.org</a>.</p>\n<p>Hard line break follows<br />\nnext line. Inline math <span class=\"math math-inline math-source\">e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0</span> and a <span class=\"tag\">#tag</span> and a <a href=\"Wiki%20Link.md\">Wiki Link</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"app\">App<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#app\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Heading named \"App\" — its id must not shadow the app's <code>#app</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-lists\">1. Lists<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-lists\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>one</li>\n<li>two\n<ul>\n<li>nested <strong>two.a</strong></li>\n<li>nested two.b\n<ol>\n<li>deep ordered</li>\n<li>deep ordered two</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>three</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>first</li>\n<li>second\n<blockquote>\n<p>quoted inside a list</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\ntask open</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/>\ntask done</li>\n</ul>\n<dl>\n<dt>Term</dt>\n<dd>Definition of the term.</dd>\n</dl>\n<h2 id=\"tables\">Tables<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tables\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align: left\">Left</th><th style=\"text-align: center\">Center</th><th style=\"text-align: right\">Right</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: left\">a</td><td style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>b</strong></td><td style=\"text-align: right\"><code>c</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: left\">long cell with a <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a></td><td style=\"text-align: center\">x</td><td style=\"text-align: right\">1.0</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"quotes-and-callouts\">Quotes and callouts<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#quotes-and-callouts\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A plain quote\nspanning two lines.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nested quote.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"note\" data-callout-type=\"note\">\n<div class=\"callout-title\"><svg class=\"callout-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"/><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z\"/></svg><span class=\"callout-title-inner\">Note</span></div>\n<div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p>A note callout with <strong>markup</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"warning\" data-callout-type=\"warning\">\n<div class=\"callout-title\"><svg class=\"callout-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.7 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg><span class=\"callout-title-inner\">Custom title</span></div>\n<div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p>A warning callout.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"tip\" data-callout-type=\"tip\">\n<div class=\"callout-title\"><svg class=\"callout-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z\"/></svg><span class=\"callout-title-inner\">Tip</span></div>\n<div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p>Tip.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"important\" data-callout-type=\"important\">\n<div class=\"callout-title\"><svg class=\"callout-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/><path d=\"M12 7v4M12 15h.01\"/></svg><span class=\"callout-title-inner\">Important</span></div>\n<div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p>Important.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"caution\" data-callout-type=\"caution\">\n<div class=\"callout-title\"><svg class=\"callout-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7.9 2h8.2L22 7.9v8.2L16.1 22H7.9L2 16.1V7.9Z\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4M12 16h.01\"/></svg><span class=\"callout-title-inner\">Caution</span></div>\n<div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p>Caution.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"code\">Code<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#code\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-rust\">fn main() {\n    println!(\"hello &lt;world&gt; &amp; \\\"friends\\\"\");\n}\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>indented code block\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>no language\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"math\">Math<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#math\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p><span class=\"math math-display math-source\">\n\\int_0^1 x^2 \\, dx = \\frac{1}{3}\n</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"media\">Media<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#media\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/build-passing-green.svg\" alt=\"A badge\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n<img src=\"images/missing.png\" alt=\"Missing local picture\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<h2 id=\"footnotes\">Footnotes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#footnotes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>A claim with a footnote.<sup class=\"footnote-reference\"><a href=\"#1\">1</a></sup> And another.<sup class=\"footnote-reference\"><a href=\"#note\">2</a></sup></p>\n<div class=\"footnote-definition\" id=\"1\"><sup class=\"footnote-definition-label\">1</sup>\n<p>The first footnote.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footnote-definition\" id=\"note\"><sup class=\"footnote-definition-label\">2</sup>\n<p>A named footnote with <code>code</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<hr />\n&lt;div onclick=\"alert(1)\"&gt;raw html is shown as text&lt;/div&gt;\n<p>Final paragraph.</p>\n",
